      "value": "@{5ba7bfe0a83dfa7a363b12b1|full_name} Yes i've read nvidia call it 'Late Warp'. I knew of it but i didn't know it already existed in SteamVR which is good. I would still love to see Reflex Integration for Desktop use if not see how well it preforms different in VR with NVIDIAs rendition of this technology. Although, by the looks of it they dont seem to explicitly say or state anything regarding support for reflex 2.0 on VR so a few of things i said in my post are misleading.",
